  "id": "butternut-and-acorn-squash-soup",
  "name": "Butternut and Acorn Squash Soup",
  "subtitle": "A smooth, gently spiced squash soup",
  "description": "Roasted winter squash is combined with sautéed onion, broth, cream cheese, and warm spices for a rich, smooth soup.",
